## Figures

The `figures/` directory contains scripts used to generate the visualizations in this study, including both single-omics and multi-omics analyses.

Scripts are organized by figure type (e.g., nine-quadrant scatter plots, enrichment plots, and multi-omics visualizations), rather than by data modality, to reflect their direct correspondence to the figures presented in the manuscript.

Some visualization scripts are shared across multiple omics layers (e.g., transcriptomics and proteomics) and are implemented in a generalized manner.

The scripts reproduce the main figures and may require minor adjustments depending on the computational environment.
